{"id":"000W69","title":"Cross-Stitch (X-Sums, Bishopsgate)","author":"Allagem","solvedCount":5,"difficulty":3,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-11-22T16:21:09+00:00","posted":"Heute, 13:03 Uhr","rules":"This is my first foray into X-Sums, and I wanted to share a satisfyingly symmetric layout featuring Bishopsgate, a constraint created by cristophermoore! To my knowledge, this is the first Bishopsgate puzzle to use the checkerboard color that excludes the main diagonals. This makes the constraint somewhat weaker than in previous Bishopsgate puzzles, but it can still be surprisingly powerful once the deductions get going!\n\nI hope you enjoy my latest puzzle, Cross-Stitch!\n\nSolve on SudokuPad\n\nNormal Sudoku rules apply.\n\nX-Sums: Clues outside the grid indicate the sum of the first X digits in that row or column, where X is the first digit seen from that direction.\n\nBishopsgate: Digits cannot repeat along any diagonal of shaded cells. This restriction does not apply to unshaded cells.\n\nFor more Bishopsgate, check out Cris's original Bishopsgate and my previous puzzle, Bishop's Gatehouse!","solutionCode":"Row 2","tags":["Sudoku","X-Sums (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/p6rmgaveop","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/p6rmgaveop","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["overlays","underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-22T16:21:09+00:00"}